# Milestone 11 (Venue) final correctness review.
# 1. Lost record write healed by later writes; record binds the complete journal prefix: commit-record.test.ts 'D-6 final correctness review' (confirmation tests, no code change needed).
# 2. Migration identity: a torn residue was accepted if it was ANY strict prefix of the intended record, so a residue shorter
#    than the checksum (e.g. {"base":15,"checksum":") identified no approval. Fixed: the residue must contain the record's full checksum.
#    BEFORE = the M11 working tree with the old rule restored in a scratch copy; AFTER = the fixed tree.
# 3. Phase V write trap and repair read-back: commit-record.test.ts 'D-6 final correctness review' (confirmation tests).

